      <title>Nearside 0.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:55:33 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>242</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.0.22000</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>USB works with more phones: plug in the phone and Nearside moves to the cable.</li>
<li>If another program (adb, Android Studio) is using the phone's USB connection, the panel says so, and Nearside moves to the cable once it's free.</li>
<li>More detail in the log file, for troubleshooting.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
